---
title: "invest (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_paused: investor submits application with capital
    q_check_paused --> q_check_ended: not paused
    q_check_paused --> q_revert_paused: contract paused
    q_check_ended --> q_verify_sig: hasEnded == false
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_ended: sale ended
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_amount: signature valid from authorized signer
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: invalid signature
    q_check_amount --> q_update: amount >= minimumInvestAmount
    q_check_amount --> q_revert_amount: below minimum
    q_update --> q_transfer: position.investedCapital += amount, totalInvestedCapital += amount
    q_transfer --> q_emit: transferFrom(investor, address(this), amount)
    q_transfer --> q_revert_transfer: transfer failed
    q_emit --> [*]: emit Invested(investor, amount)
    q_revert_paused --> [*]: revert Paused
    q_revert_ended --> [*]: revert SaleEnded
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_revert_amount --> [*]: revert BelowMinimum
    q_revert_transfer --> [*]: revert TransferFailed

    note right of q_update
        INV-001: Capital represents maximum allocation commitment
        INV-002: Final allocation determined by project evaluation (not guaranteed)
        INV-003: No predetermined allocation rate (unlike approved sale)
    end note
